      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\ncompliance_note_translate.py - Translate encryption or compliance notes for reviewers\ncrypto_audit_embedding.py - Embed crypto audit notes for semantic search\ndecrypt_payload.py - decrypts a ciphertext payload with a managed key\nencrypt_payload.py - encrypts a plaintext payload with a managed key\nenvelope_encrypt.py - implements envelope encryption using a managed key service\nkey_usage_summary.py - Summarize key usage and crypto events\npayload_safety.py - Check decrypted text payloads for unsafe content\nsecurity_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Key Management and Encryption\nsecurity_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Key Management and Encryption\nsign_or_verify_key.py - uses a managed key service for signing or verification where supported\n\nCreate decrypt_payload.py in the current working directory.\nTask: decrypts a ciphertext payload with a managed key.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc12249a001oOV25voYVh0IWR",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc122498001Q9VcstDkesz9ue",
