      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Encryption Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud KMS as the managed key service for encrypting the payload. I'm focusing now on how to cleanly integrate the provider's specifics into the `encrypt_payload.py` file to keep the code organized and easily maintainable.\n\n\n**Implementing KMS Encryption**\n\nI'm now integrating the Google Cloud KMS client within `encrypt_payload.py`. I'm structuring the code to include a specific `encrypt_payload` function that accepts parameters for project, location, key ring, key ID, and the plaintext itself. I am aiming to use the client to encrypt the plaintext and returning the resulting ciphertext.\n\n\n",
